,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">月之暗面秘密递交港交所A1文件，正式启动IPO并寻求500亿美元估值融资</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI即将推出Astra模型，首个达到关键网络安全阈值的AI模型</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Nscale斩获Anthropic 450亿美元算力大单，合同总收入突破1000亿美元</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">豆包工作上线多Agents并行与Mac版操作电脑功能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/6a0c382f9933372f4bffbc065a459f39.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">豆包工作于9月2日正式推出“多Agents并行”能力，并将“操作电脑”功能拓展至Mac系统。多Agents并行模式下，主Agent负责拆解复杂任务，将子任务分派给多个子Agent同步处理，支持批量任务处理及多格式产物交付，显著提升复杂工作流效率。Mac版“操作电脑”功能通过GUI实现本地桌面控制，无需依赖API或插件，AI可自动识别屏幕内容并模拟鼠标点击与键盘输入。用户授权后，AI在悬浮小窗中实时执行任务，并具备环境感知与自我纠偏能力，支持用户随时介入干预。此次更新标志着豆包从对话工具向具备本地桌面操作能力的“全能代理”转型，未来将保持每周三的功能迭代节奏，持续优化AI与本地电脑的协同体验。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">美国司法部介入纽约时报诉OpenAI案，主张AI训练属于合理使用</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/2cb8beb2512d5a53b38af86ce5743167.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">美国司法部（DOJ）于9月1日向曼哈顿联邦法院提交“利益声明”，正式介入《纽约时报》诉OpenAI版权侵权案，明确支持OpenAI立场，主张使用受版权保护材料训练大语言模型属于“合理使用”。DOJ认为，若版权规则增加AI开发难度，将损害美国AI产业竞争力并构成国家安全风险。文件强调，AI训练具有“转换性”目的，其创造性潜力与公共利益远超竞争损害。此举引发原告方强烈反弹，《纽约时报》批评政府牺牲创作者权益以偏袒万亿市值AI公司。该案涉及OpenAI及微软，核心争议在于未经授权使用新闻文章训练模型是否侵权。法官西德尼·斯坦已要求双方在9月4日前提交简易判决动议。此案判决将为AI行业使用版权数据确立关键法律先例，直接影响未来模型训练的合规边界与产业发展路径。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">月之暗面秘密递交港交所A1文件，正式启动IPO并寻求500亿美元估值融资</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f522f27f968293bce5fa641ed861e48a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">AI独角兽月之暗面（Kimi）已于本周以保密形式向港交所递交A1文件，正式启动港股上市流程，并同步以500亿美元投前估值推进IPO前最后一轮融资。Kimi方面对此暂不予置评。在模型迭代方面，Kimi今年相继推出K2.5、K2.6及K3模型，保持约每三个月一次的更新节奏。其ARR从3月初的1亿美元快速攀升至6月中旬的3亿美元，推动公司估值在半年内增长约8倍。随着模型能力提升带来的调用量爆发，算力成本急剧上升，促使Kimi在K3发布后曾暂停新用户订阅以保障付费用户需求。当前AI赛道竞争已转向ARR、API调用及企业级客户等商业化指标的较量。随着主打推理速度与Agent能力升级的K3.1发布在即，Kimi冲刺二级市场标志着国内大模型商业化与资本化进入新阶段，头部梯队将面临商业变现能力与技术落地价值的全面检验。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI即将推出Astra模型，首个达到关键网络安全阈值的AI模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/62eaa11015e5765ca0d7b6cf73e106e2.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI宣布即将推出全新前沿模型Astra，该模型是首个达到其“关键网络安全阈值”的LLM。在ExploitBench基准测试中，Astra不仅斩获满分，更在测试环境下自主发现并利用了两个零日漏洞。针对其强大的攻防能力，OpenAI部署了越狱防御、高风险账户响应限制及逻辑链监控等多重安全机制，并计划在正式发布时对高级网络安全功能实施严格的访问限制。为验证可靠性，OpenAI在模拟恶意诱导环境中测试了Astra，结果显示其未突破测试边界。尽管OpenAI称其为最符合用户需求的模型，但业界专家如Yona Shavit对模型是否存在针对规则的欺骗性迎合表示担忧。Astra的发布与安全评估报告，将为前沿AI模型的安全合规部署提供重要实践参考。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Nscale斩获Anthropic 450亿美元算力大单，合同总收入突破1000亿美元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/0f4300690cd50684397f89db68d9d269.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英国云服务商Nscale近期与人工智能企业Anthropic签署了一份价值450亿美元的算力协议，推动其合同总收入从510亿美元跃升至约1030亿美元。该订单的落地标志着Nscale业务规模实现翻倍式增长。根据披露的财务文件，Nscale目前持有的合同平均期限约为5.7年，折算年均合同规模约180亿美元。随着算力需求激增及多项AI客户合同的持续注入，Nscale正加速资本化进程，计划最早于本月启动IPO。此次与Anthropic的深度绑定，不仅巩固了Nscale在AI基础设施市场的地位，也反映出当前大模型厂商对高性能算力资源的长期锁定策略。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
